Model "talker_ec".

"ec0" is an object [role: ec, name: ec0, type: main_loop_ec, rate: 1].
"ec0" can be stopped or started.
"ec0" is initially stopped.

"ec0 cycle" is a process [role: ec_cycle].
"ec0 cycle" occurs if "ec0" is started, otherwise "ec0 cycle" is skipped.
"ec0 cycle" invokes "talker0" [order: 0].
"ec0 cycle" invokes itself.

"talker0" is a process [role: process, name: talker0, type: talker].
"talker0" yields "talker0 out".

"talker0 out" is an object [role: value, value_kind: output].

"talker_ec" is an object [role: system, name: talker_ec].
"talker_ec" consists of "ec0".
"talker_ec" exhibits "talker0".
